      <div class="modal-head">
        <h3 class="modal-title" id="supportModalTitle">Help &amp; Support</h3>
        <button type="button" class="modal-close-btn" aria-label="Close" onclick="closeModal('supportModal')">✕</button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body info-dialog-body">
        <p class="info-dialog-intro" id="supportModalSummary">Find the next step for a booking, a payment question, or a problem using PICKLERS.</p>
        <section>
          <h4>Check your booking first</h4>
          <p>Open <a href="{{ url_to('app.php?tab=bookings') }}">My Bookings</a> to check your request status, scheduled time, booking reference, and available actions. Court reservations and Open Play requests require facility owner approval; a pending request is not a confirmed reservation.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h4>Payments and refunds</h4>
          <p>Check your Pickle Credits balance and transaction history in <a href="{{ url_to('app.php?tab=wallet') }}">Wallet</a>. Real-money top-ups are currently unavailable. For GCash, Maya, or cash arrangements made outside the app, contact the facility directly. Selecting a payment method in PICKLERS is not proof of payment.</p>
          <p>Before cancelling, read the refund information shown with your booking. The Terms of Service explain the pending and confirmed booking rules.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h4>If something is not working</h4>
          <p>Check your internet connection and reopen the affected page. Before retrying a booking or payment-related action, check My Bookings and Wallet to avoid sending a duplicate request.</p>
          <p>When asking for help, include the booking reference, facility, date and time, what you expected, and the message shown. Never share your password, verification codes, or full payment credentials.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h4>Getting help from a person</h4>
          <p>Ask the facility about court access, schedules, booking approval, or external payments. For account access or a technical issue, contact the person or organization running this installation.</p>
          <p class="info-dialog-note">No monitored support email or hotline is configured for this installation. This dialog does not submit a support ticket.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
      <div class="info-dialog-footer">
        <button type="button" class="btn-view-courts info-dialog-close" onclick="closeModal('supportModal')">Close</button>
      </div>
    </div>
